{"articleNo":"161932","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=161932&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[11.21-11.23] 2016 겨울계절수업 수강신청 정원 외 개별 추가신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2016.11.21","hit":"5141","attachments":[{"name":"정원외수강신청서(서식).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=161932&attachNo=5004"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">2016 겨울계절수업 수강신청 정원 외 개별 추가신청 안내</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">1. 신청 대상 : 원스톱서비스에 신청 정원이 마감된 강좌</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">※ 수강불가 대상 : 2016-2 동일과목 및 선수과목 수강 중인 학생 및 휴학생</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. 허용 범위 : 과목별 담당교수의 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">허가가 있는 경우</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">에는 신청 가능</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">3. 허용 기간 : 수강신청기간 내 교무처로 제출자에 한함</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; [</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">2016. 11. 23.(수) 16:00까지</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">]</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">4. 신청 절차 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">수강신청서 양식[</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">첨부파일</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">] 작성 → 담당교수 서명 → 교무처(본관 201호) 제출</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">○ 담당교수연구실 확인 :</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\"> [원스톱서비스 - 학사관리 - 수강신청 - 개설강좌조회 - ‘겨울계절학기’ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">선택 조회 - </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">강의계획서]</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">5. 제출처 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">교무처 학사관리팀(본관201호)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">6. 수강학점 : 6학점 이내</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">★</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">계절수업 수강 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">환불 신청(취소)는 다음에 해당하는 경우만 가능</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 질병, 취업, 군입대 등 부득이한 사유로 계절수업 수강 자체가 불가능한 자 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">[증빙서류</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">(입원확인서, 입영통지서, 취업확인서 등) </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">미지참 시 취소 및 환불 불가]</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"></p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.85pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.85pt solid; WIDTH: 136.86pt; BACKGROUND: #f1f1f1; HEIGHT: 25.14pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.85pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.85pt solid\" valign=\"middle\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">구 분</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-